status: FAIL

findings:
- **HIGH — frozen-form rule is not enforced for unused imports.** The specification admits only the three frozen pure shapes and assigns pure-shape judgment to adapter-validation step 4 (`docs/spec/EFFECT_SYSTEM_V1.md:101-125,359-368`). Instead, `validate_adapters` accepts every closed zero-effect row (`crates/sley-check/src/effects.rs:538-559`); shape judgment occurs only when an import is invoked (`:832-845`). Thus an unused `Bytes -> Bool`, wrong-failure, or other arbitrary effectless row passes S20-230. This broadens static acceptance beyond the owner’s narrow decision, although it grants no callable native authority.
- **INFO — SH2 remains Sley-owned.** The semantic-authority exclusions are explicit and comprehensive (`docs/spec/EFFECT_SYSTEM_V1.md:146-153`; `rw-030-g10-admission.md:131-143,209-213`).
- **INFO — form/registration layering is sound and currently fail-closed.** S20-230 intentionally ignores identity/version; present lowering refuses unsupported opcodes (`crates/sley-vm/src/lower.rs:633-636`; `extended.rs:804`). Re-landing must preserve positive identity/version/profile registration before execution.
- **INFO — round-3 HIGH 2 is repaired.** P-PUSH enforces `scope == response == Vector<request>` (`effects.rs:596-603`) with a negative relationship test (`:1875-1884`).
- **INFO — monomorphization is coherent.** Adapter schemas undergo closed-type judgment (`effects.rs:555-557`), and open rows preserve `TYPE_PARAMETER_OUT_OF_SCOPE` (`:2017-2025`).
- **INFO — old rules remain intact.** `>1` effects retains `ADAPTER_EFFECT_CARDINALITY`; a single non-`AdapterCall` retains `ADAPTER_EFFECT_KIND` (`effects.rs:546-553,1766-1791`). No effect is manufactured, and only the pure invocation arm omits closure insertion (`:836-861`); least-fixed-point construction is otherwise unchanged.
- **INFO — enforcement homes:** identity/version and import-to-shape binding belong to RW-050/RW-070 registration; bounds, charging, deterministic failures, purity, SH2 exclusions, and conformance belong to the profile/runtime/test lanes (`EFFECT_SYSTEM_V1.md:133-153`). The missing enforcement is the row-level frozen-form check assigned to S20-230 itself.

